kedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-10T02:22:58-08:00","id":1184304,"title":"","content":"This is a cool and simple narrativist approach to games of Influence. I like it a lot.<br /> <br /> My first thoughts:<br /> <br /> There is some general editing to be done to clean up the text, some words are missing, some words are doubled. It leads to confusion here and there. If you want (and when I have time) I can mark the places in your document.<br /> <br /> I am confused by the way in which Assets can improve or reduce a Trait's rating. How come the number of Added Assets needed to improve a rating is greater than the number of Removed Assets needed to reduce a rating?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2081-howalt","name":"Howalt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2081_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-10T02:31:49-08:00","id":1184305,"title":"","content":"I would love some mark ups. I will try to go over it again.<br /> <br /> <br /> As for the assets - it should be exactly the same. You start with your total traits of Assets assigned to each trait. To increase a trait, you need to double the number of Assets, and since you already have - you just need to get the same number amount. If you want to reduce it, you need to take away the same number... uh... I got confused even writing this. Here's an example: <br /> <br /> Faction:<br /> Neighborhood Friendly Home carers (Size 1, Power 1, Influence 2, Resistance 3) each of these traits have 7 Assets to start with. Not sure how to write it up properly.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode__table--wrapper text_table_\"><table class=\"b-bbcode__table text_table\" style=\"width: 500px\"><tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\"></td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">Size</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">Power</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">Influence</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">Resistance</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">Trait</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">1</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">1</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">2</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">3</td> </tr> <tr valign=\"top\" class=\"text_table_tr\"><td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">Assets</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">7</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">7</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">7</td> <td class=\"text_table_td\" style=\"border-width: 1px; padding: 1px\">7</td> </tr> </table></div> Now, to increase Influence, this group needs to gain 7 more Assets in Influence. To lose a dot of Influence - the group needs to lose 7 Assets in Influence.<br /> <br /> Does that make it clearer, do I need something like this in the doc?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B5_EJSgV1u4SOFFJc3M5VmFDWVk?resourcekey=0-GEErNnDbGqlKYgoiuGausw&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Bloodline conversions</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1IbeKfqhWuG8jPN9vpGmDo0VY9n9-4ejxvRzfJRoir4k/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My House rules</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/294-griautis","name":"Griautis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar294_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-10T02:48:59-08:00","id":1184310,"title":"","content":"To me it reads like this:<br /> <br /> - Count total Trait dots (7 in your example)<br /> - This is the amount of Assets associated with each trait.<br /> - Therefore, total amount of Assets is 7x4 = 28<br /> - To add 1 extra Trait dot, you need to double the total amount of Assets<br /> - Therefore, you have to win 28 Assets.<br /> <br /> I think in your description of the mechanics you need to clearly outline that in order to raise a <i>specific</i> Trait, you will need to win an amount of Assets that is equal to the amount of Assets currently associated with that specific Trait. Though, apparantly, the kinds of Assets you win in order to double that amount need not be of the kind associated with the Trait. Which I (now) understand from a mechanical point of view (as raising any one Trait by 1 also increases the number of Assets associated with all other Traits), however narratively it is a bit strange. Not overly problematically so, but still.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2081-howalt","name":"Howalt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2081_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"303"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-10T03:24:36-08:00","id":1184315,"title":"","content":"It's an abstraction based on bigger organisations are harder to change. If you're 10 people gang, then you need to get your hands on less weaponry to increase in Power, compared to a 200 men crime syndicate. Anyways, I'll rewrite the section about assets","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B5_EJSgV1u4SOFFJc3M5VmFDWVk?resourcekey=0-GEErNnDbGqlKYgoiuGausw&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Bloodline conversions</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1IbeKfqhWuG8jPN9vpGmDo0VY9n9-4ejxvRzfJRoir4k/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My House rules</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/294-griautis","name":"Griautis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar294_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}